# Review: SandboxPlugin

Every operation in the spec is declared (`types/SandboxOperation.ts`, `types/RepositoryOperation.ts`)
with the specified keys and has a handler in `skills/functions`. The sandbox ops run against
`SandboxService.Service` and are exercised end to end by the local-backend suite
(`testing/LocalSandbox.test.ts`, skipped where the OS sandbox is unavailable) and the composer harness
test. Repository handlers exist, but only the EDGE repository client is tested, not
`attachRepository`, `createRepository` or the log read. The one schema gap: `exec` has no `stdin`
input. The ops also carry fields the spec omits (`accountAccess`/`accountTokenEnv` on
`createSandbox`, `credentials` on `Sandbox`, plus an unspecified `grantAccountAccess` op).
QA-2 has no automated counterpart.

Of 15 items: 9 done, 3 untested, 2 partial (exec, QA-1), 0 diverged, 1 missing (QA-2).

## Extensions

| Term      | URI                        |
| --------- | -------------------------- |
| `verdict` | `org.dxos.mdl.verdict@1.0` |

