```mdl
verdict exec: Runs a command with cwd, env, timeout and background, but the op has no stdin input.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-sandbox/src/types/SandboxOperation.ts#Exec, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-sandbox/src/skills/functions/exec.ts, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-sandbox/src/services/exec-stream.ts#foldExecStream]
