  walkthrough:
    - The operation declares the command and its options. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-sandbox/src/types/SandboxOperation.ts#Exec
    - The handler merges credential env and reports a request failure as a failed command. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-sandbox/src/skills/functions/exec.ts
